 "about_text": "Feia is a Los Angeles gallery founded by husband-duo Thomas Martinez Pilnik and Jake Cavallo. The name, Portuguese for \"ugly,\" reflects a program built around curiosity, humor, and unconventional beauty rather than conventional polish. Pilnik, an artist and educator, and Cavallo, a designer with an architecture background, run Feia as a hybrid of exhibitions, events, dinners, and workshops emphasizing community and food alongside visual art. The gallery represents a small roster of emerging painters, sculptors, and mixed-media artists exploring queer identity, memory, and domestic space, and is especially active on the art fair circuit across Los Angeles, New York, Miami, and Chicago. It has also built a new gallery space in the Highland Park neighborhood of Los Angeles.",
